                    "content": ".carousel-wrapper {\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n  position: relative;\n  touch-action: pan-x;\n}\n\n.carousel-container {\n  display: flex;\n  transform: translate3d(0, -100%, 0);\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n}\n\n.carousel-item {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  object-fit: contain;\n\n  * {\n    user-select: none;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n}\n\n.carousel-pagination {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  position: absolute !important;\n  padding-top: 5px; // 为了更方便编辑态选择\n  bottom: 0px;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  :global {\n    .dot {\n      margin: 0 3px;\n      width: 9px;\n      height: 9px;\n      background-color: hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.3);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n    }\n    .dot.active {\n      background-color: #fa6400;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
