                "content": "export const undoIcon = `data:image/svg+xml;base64,`;\n\nexport const redoIcon = `data:image/svg+xml;base64,`;\n\nexport const boldIcon = `data:image/svg+xml;base64,`;\n\nexport const imageIcon = `data:image/svg+xml;base64,`;\n\nexport const videoIcon = `data:image/svg+xml;base64,`;\n"
