                "content": "<svg t=\"1691142422390\" class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13500\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path d=\"M799.744 799.744h64v64h-64v-64z m-128 0h64v64h-64v-64z m-128 0h64v64h-64v-64z m-128 0h64v64H415.744v-64z m-256 0h64v64H159.744v-64z m0-640h64v64H159.744V159.744z m128 640h64v64H287.744v-64z m-128-128h64v64H159.744v-64z m0-128h64v64H159.744v-64z m0-128h64v64H159.744V415.744z m0-128h64v64H159.744V287.744z m640 384h64v64h-64v-64z m0-128h64v64h-64v-64z m0-128h64v64h-64V415.744z m0-128h64v64h-64V287.744z m0-128h64v64h-64V159.744z m-128 0h64v64h-64V159.744z m-128 0h64v64h-64V159.744z m-128 0h64v64H415.744V159.744z m-128 0h64v64H287.744V159.744z\" fill=\"#555555\" p-id=\"13501\"></path><path d=\"M896 64H128c-35.328 0-64 28.672-64 64v768c0 35.328 28.672 64 64 64h768c35.328 0 64-28.672 64-64V128c0-35.328-28.672-64-64-64z m0 800.256c0 19.456-12.8 31.744-31.744 31.744H159.744c-19.456 0-31.744-12.8-31.744-31.744V159.744c0-19.456 12.8-31.744 31.744-31.744h704c19.456 0 31.744 12.8 31.744 31.744v704.512z\" fill=\"#555555\" p-id=\"13502\"></path></svg>"
